ation, so can be moved to separate cleanup PR for 4.6, with full performance tests and replacing all `NSString` conversion cases if it worth it), it's bugfix for iOS/visionOS export and definitely is OK for 4.5.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2982789489/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2985612494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107574#issuecomment-2985612494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107574","id":2985612494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x9NTO","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T20:33:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T20:33:59Z","body":"@AThousandShips incorporated your feedback, thanks!\r\n\r\n@bruvzg / @clayjohn – agreed – I've removed `foundation_helpers` from this PR","author_associatio